WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:07.895
Look at me!

2
00:00:07.896 --> 00:00:17.018
I can do everything by myself.

3
00:00:17.019 --> 00:00:25.853
I can wake up by myself.

4
00:00:25.854 --> 00:00:31.190
I can make my bed.

5
00:00:31.191 --> 00:00:37.256
I can brush my teeth.

6
00:00:37.257 --> 00:00:48.240
I can wash my face.

7
00:00:48.241 --> 00:00:57.905
I can pour milk onto my cereal.

8
00:00:57.906 --> 00:01:07.714
I can pack my bag.

9
00:01:07.715 --> 00:01:13.871
I can put my shirt on.

10
00:01:13.872 --> 00:01:25.117
I can put my socks on.

11
00:01:25.118 --> 00:01:33.253
I can button my jacket.

12
00:01:33.254 --> 00:01:38.934
I can tie my shoes.

13
00:01:38.935 --> 00:01:41.569
Look at me!

14
00:01:41.570 --> 00:01:52.798
I can do everything by myself.

15
00:01:52.799 --> 00:01:59.142
Mother said, "Yes, you can do everything by yourself.

16
00:01:59.143 --> 00:02:08.876
But today is Sunday. There is no school today."

